# What perf/instrumentation is built from (ops/loop/rebuild-perf-branch.sh).
#
#   base <ref>         the code under test starts here (normally origin/main)
#   candidate <ref>    a branch to test on top of it; merged in this order
#
# The perf-only commits (subject "perf-only: ...") are replayed onto base
# before the candidates. Edit this file, commit it as "perf-only: ...",
# then rebuild. Every eval run records the resolved SHAs.
base origin/main
